#5900
The Lair of the Aspis~
This is the home and breeding ground of the weevil-looking aspis.  This area
will hopefully be for 35th to 40th level players.  Created by Joe Hunter.
~
59 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#5901
Dark Earthy Pit~
An iron ladder, which is fixed to the wall, descends from a circular shaft to 
a dirt tunnel.  There are many, strange tracks in the mud around the ladder
and the air is damp and foul.  Somewhere in the distance you hear faint
clicking noises.
~
