#5904
A Dark, Musty Chamber~
This chamber has been crudely delved from the earth.  While the walls, floor
and ceiling are slighty muddy they show no signs of crumbling.  Wooden beams
also support the ceiling in this chamber but there are no wooden planks
covering it.  The whole chamber is no more than 20 feet in diameter.  Back to
the west seems to be the only way out.
~
59 41 0 0 0 3 255 0
D3
You see a dark passage to the west.
~
~
