#5956
The Aspis Breeding Chamber~
This chamber is a large cavern over 60 feet in diameter.  The ceiling is 12
to 14 feet high and supported by long planks stretching from wall to wall and
huge beams running from the ceiling to the floor.  The floor is covered in 2
to 3 inches of mud because of puddled water.  The heat in this cavern is
almost unbearable.  West, back to the nursery appears to be the only way out.
