A Dark Muddy Tunnel~
This tunnel has been dug through the soil and the sides are hard packed.  The
ceiling is  8 to 9 feet high, roofed by wooden planks and supported by large,
wooden beams spaced approximately 5 feet apart.  The hard packed floor of the
tunnel is slightly slick due to the thin layer of mud covering it.  There are
passages to the north, east and west.
